ids a new Unreal package for content-only updates;\\ndirectly opening the app retains the portable, embedded-deck behavior.\\n''';p.write_text(s)\\nPY\\ncp unreal/Saved/Screenshots/cast-vim.png docs/screenshots/cast-vim.png\\ncp unreal/Saved/Screenshots/gate-open.png docs/screenshots/gate-open.png\\ntail -8 /tmp/cast-refresh-package.log\",max_output_tokens:500}));\n","name":"exec","session_id":"01a07b6d-991e-7c80-a5ae-46e3d782481b","source_line":7591,"timestamp":"2026-09-09T08:18:32.297Z","type":"custom_tool_call"}
